## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/<% .Snake %>.gleam` | The main module; `main` is the entry point for `gleam run` |
| `test/` | gleeunit tests: public functions ending in `_test` |
| `gleam.toml` | Package name, version and Hex dependencies |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

Gleam compiles to Erlang (the default) or JavaScript (`gleam run --target javascript`).

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
